 "description": "It has an answer for lots of religious and life questions. -- About the author -- Wolde Giyorgis Wolde Yohannes (Amharic: ወልደ ጊዮርጊስ ወልደ ዮሐንስ; 1901–29 July 1976) was an important government Minister during the reign of Haile Selassie of Ethiopia. Between 1941 and his downfall in 1955, he came to dominate Ethiopian politics for a decade and a half, not only serving as Tsehafi Taezaz or Minister of the Pen (1941–1955), but at times Minister of t",
